# poster/ was gitignored as scratch, but the 17 posters are production assets:
# every JSON-LD Product.image points at poster/{slug}.jpg. Tracked 2026-08-28.

# pre-edit backups (never commit)
*.pre_*

# PAID ARTIFACTS — NEVER COMMIT. Public deployment = revenue leak.
